OL,4,Aas traitor behaviour splits opinion
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from episode seven of The
OL,8,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,10,FSix days is a long time in The
OL,11,FCelebrity Traitors.
OL,13,FSo it was a relief to be put out of our
OL,14,Fmisery as last Friday's literal
OL,15,Fyawn-fest came to its slow-burning
OL,16,Fconclusion; the traitorous trio
OL,17,Feventually succeeding in their mission
OL,18,Fto kill in plain sight.
